<%# locals: (bookmark:) %>
<%# A bookmark's tags in its muted line on a phone (frame phone-bookmarks.png), as text, since a one-line row has no
    room for 44px links. The signed-in person's own only, through tags_for (docs/design/tags.md, Traps). %>
<% tags = bookmark.tags_for(Current.user).sort_by(&:name) %>
<% if tags.any? %> · <%= tags.map { "##{it.name}" }.join(" ") %><% end %>
